          // the raw `split_files/` SOURCE (one entry per platform), and the q4/q8/bf16 matrix is
          // packed ON-DEVICE by the `anima_quant` converter. `residentMemoryBytes` /
          // `peakMemoryBytes` are per-TIER quantities, so on this family they have no download
          // variant to hang on at all -- the per-tier footprint seam here is the converted
