      "limits": {
        // Cosmos RoPE trained window → W×H in [512, 1536], multiples of 16 (descriptor RES_MULTIPLE=16;
        // >1536/side is rejected, not clamped). Anima routes the per-generation sampler/scheduler knobs
        // through the unified flow framework (epic 7114), so the `anima_base` descriptor advertises
        // curated_sampler_names()/curated_scheduler_names() — this `limits` menu is a subset (the
