        // vae_stride.2 = 8)` = 16 (mlx-gen-bernini/src/bernini.rs:646) and candle enforces
        // `SIZE_MULTIPLE_14B = 16` via `is_multiple_of` (candle-gen-bernini/src/config.rs:155).
